# HTML Full Syllabus

## 📌 Introduction to HTML
- What is HTML?
- History & Evolution of HTML
- Basic Structure of an HTML Document
- HTML Editors (VS Code, Sublime, Notepad++)

## 🏗️ Basic HTML Elements
### ✅ Text Elements
- Headings (`<h1>` to `<h6>`)
- Paragraph (`<p>`)
- Line Break (`<br>`) & Horizontal Rule (`<hr>`)

### ✅ Formatting Tags
- Bold (`<b>`), Italic (`<i>`), Underline (`<u>`)
- Strong (`<strong>`), Emphasis (`<em>`)
- Subscript (`<sub>`) & Superscript (`<sup>`)

### ✅ Lists
- Ordered List (`<ol>`) & Unordered List (`<ul>`)
- Definition List (`<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`)

### ✅ Links & Anchors
- Internal & External Links (`<a href>`)
- Email (`mailto:`) & Telephone (`tel:`) Links

### ✅ Images
- Image Tag (`<img>` with `src`, `alt`, `width`, `height`)
- Responsive Images (`<picture>`)
- Image Maps & SVG

## 🎯 HTML Forms & Inputs
### ✅ Form Basics
- Form (`<form>`), Input Fields (`<input>`) & Labels (`<label>`)
- Fieldset & Legend (`<fieldset>`, `<legend>`)
- Buttons (`<button>`, `submit`, `reset`)
- Dropdown (`<select>`, `<option>`)
- Textarea (`<textarea>`)

### ✅ Form Validation
- Required Fields (`required`)
- Patterns (`pattern="regex"`)
- Min & Max Length (`minlength`, `maxlength`)

## 📊 HTML Tables
- Table Structure (`<table>`, `<tr>`, `<td>`, `<th>`)
- Merging Cells (`rowspan`, `colspan`)
- Table Sections (`<thead>`, `<tbody>`, `<tfoot>`)
- Styling Tables with CSS

## 🎵 HTML Multimedia & Embedding
### ✅ Media Elements
- Audio (`<audio>` with `controls`)
- Video (`<video>` with `controls`)

### ✅ Embedding Content
- YouTube Videos (`<iframe>`)
- Google Maps & Social Media Widgets

## 📌 HTML Semantic Elements
- `<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<section>`
- `<article>`, `<aside>`, `<figure>`
- Accessibility & ARIA Attributes

## 🚀 Advanced HTML Features
### ✅ Meta Tags & SEO
- `<meta charset>` for Character Encoding
- `<meta name="viewport">` for Responsive Design
- Open Graph Tags for Social Media (`og:title`, `og:image`)

### ✅ HTML5 Features
- Data Attributes (`data-*`)
- Local Storage & Session Storage (`localStorage`, `sessionStorage`)

### ✅ Performance Optimization
- Lazy Loading (`loading="lazy"`)
- Preloading & Prefetching

## 📌 Best Practices in HTML
- Writing Clean & Semantic Code
- Proper Indentation & Readability
- Avoiding Deprecated Tags

